604
00:38:08,596 --> 00:38:10,357
[glass cracks sharply]

605
00:38:11,703 --> 00:38:14,602
<i>I never told Mom or Riley.</i>

606
00:38:17,502 --> 00:38:19,918
<i>After that,
I never saw it again.</i>

